                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "45503746-0c95-38f0-8e98-5d079938cba9",
                        "entry_id": "4c9199e7-9d8f-330a-96c7-18028e51c502",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fennel cultivar with a bulb-like structure at its base, used as a vegetable; Florence fennel (Foeniculum vulgare var. azoricum)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d78efe64-31fb-4694-acc9-54ae04a4c20d",
                                "sense_id": "45503746-0c95-38f0-8e98-5d079938cba9",
                                "text": "Finocchios are shoots of the fennel, an odoriferous plant of the Umbelliferae family."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1607f4c-71cf-4551-b805-207d72633e16",
                                "sense_id": "45503746-0c95-38f0-8e98-5d079938cba9",
                                "text": "For the first time, finocchio, or Florence fennel, has performed for me as it should and has swollen out into bulbous protrusions at the base of its leaf stalks."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "961afdc6-0c3b-4da9-b3fc-710d42a11857",
                                "sense_id": "45503746-0c95-38f0-8e98-5d079938cba9",
                                "text": "The strong anise odor of finocchio repels many insects from other vegetables."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e51dabd-8792-4385-8ade-ca5409e81547",
                                "sense_id": "45503746-0c95-38f0-8e98-5d079938cba9",
                                "text": "Also called Florence fennel, finocchio has long been a popular vegetable in Europe but has somehow fallen out of circulation from most American gardens."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5fb4c826-6a93-36bb-8ef7-597db96f9253",
                        "entry_id": "4c9199e7-9d8f-330a-96c7-18028e51c502",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A gay man."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "491039ba-f7c7-41d5-99dc-d63918dceeae",
                                "sense_id": "5fb4c826-6a93-36bb-8ef7-597db96f9253",
                                "text": "On many, a cold freezing night, of temperatures hovering near zero, the finocchios tease and try to encourage Tedesco to join in their warm body orgies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "997e8797-984e-4ddc-9e8e-64b139f68e6d",
                                "sense_id": "5fb4c826-6a93-36bb-8ef7-597db96f9253",
                                "text": "Not to mention, he and Julie were finocchios; but at least Larry was a smart finocchio."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a265feeb-ef01-4efd-87dd-fc6d2d4ea717",
                                "sense_id": "5fb4c826-6a93-36bb-8ef7-597db96f9253",
                                "text": "“Don’ stand next to any finocchios who might try’n grab your best friend,” Vin cracked. Richie roared as Tony made his way to the men’s room."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a972df9-93c1-488c-ba7f-0f31ac09d789",
                                "sense_id": "5fb4c826-6a93-36bb-8ef7-597db96f9253",
                                "text": "Salvatore Maranzano: Rumour is you two are a pair of finocchi."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
